  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the iron teppan to 400 degrees Fahrenheit",
    "Season the cod fillets with cumin, paprika, salt, and pepper",
    "Steam the cod fillets using mushimono-steam for 8 minutes",
    "While the cod is cooking, mix the almond flour, lime juice, and olive oil in a bowl",
    "Add the almond essence to the bowl and mix well",
    "Once the cod is cooked, place it on the iron teppan and top with the almond flour mixture",
    "Cook for an additional 2 minutes on each side",
    "Serve the fish in tacos with your favorite toppings",
    "Garnish with fresh cilantro and a squeeze of lime juice"
  ],
